[Student "S"]
{Following NORTH's Jacoby 2NT, SOUTH bids 3\S. This is stronger than 4\S and 
shows a 6-card suit.

NORTH has already bid the full strength of his hand so he signs off with 4\S which SOUTH passes.}
[Play "W"]
