{This is the companion to Deal 4.

After NORTH bids 3\C to show shortage, SOUTH makes a Control-showing bid 
of 3\D.

NORTH no longer worries about losing two quick \Ds. He uses 
Blackwood to check for Aces, then bids 6\S.}
[Play "E"]
H2

